es the back of his neck zushi  recovers again and decides to resort to  a new stance that leaves kilua terrified  and causes him to quickly leak back  watching among the crowd wing suddenly  screams zushi's name and causes the  spectators around him to put their hands  over their ears he sits down with a  stern expression on his face and zushi  appears visibly shaken before the  announcer restarts the match  kelulah eventually meets up with gon who  was wondering what took him so long  killua tells him that zushi wasn't  strong he then reveals that zushi's aura  during his new stance reminded him of  his brothers oblivious to what it was  but confident that it's dangerous he  guesses that it's a technique and tells  gone that wing called it ren in a  flashback killua sees zushi on his hands  and knees apologizing to wing who  reminds him that he wasn't supposed to  use ren yet zushi says that he couldn't  resist against such a strong opponent  and wing tells him that while wanting to  win is good he needs to remember his  true goal of reaching the top four  back in the present gone wonders if  sushi isn't supposed to use ren until  reaching the top floor and kilua reveals  that he now plans to reach the top floor  as well with gon happily agreeing and  telling himself that it was his original  goal anyway gon and killua continue to  easily defeat all their opponents over  the next few days with both reaching the  100s they each receive a private room  and while gone is happy that they don't  have to worry about finding a place  killua points out that if they drop  below the 100s they have to check out it  mourns going that the competition will  become more difficult since every  opponent wants to keep their spot  however the two continue to easily win  and receive more prize money with both  noting that sushi is still in the 50s  gon again wonders about the technique  called ren  and while kilua thinks about  encountering it with opponents on the  higher fours gown 